================================================================================
Upstream lineage (ByteDance Bagel)
================================================================================

The training stack in `training/` originates from ByteDance's internal
multi-modal foundation-model codebase, internally referred to as **Bagel**.
A sibling open-source release of the same upstream code is published as
part of the Echo-4o repository under `modeling/bagel/` (see entry 7 below).

Files such as `training/modeling/shared/modeling_utils.py`,
`training/modeling/qwen2/*`, and several modules under `training/data/` and
`training/train/` therefore exhibit high textual similarity to the
corresponding files in Echo-4o. Both releases are derivative works of the
same ByteDance-internal source and are distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

